  "description": "Verda spot lifecycle and fleet-sum cost. Never destroy fleet.yaml hosts; Verda teardown is delete_permanently (failed destroy retains FleetState ownership). Idle timer is last_client_request_at from inflight_inc on generate/chat/embed only (health, /api/ps, capacity, admin, warm-keeper do not count). Capacity miss is 503 + Retry-After + async create_additional (not ensure). Cloud Ollama URLs are Tailscale-only; public :11434 is public_url_blocked and never healthy. auto_scale min/max instance knobs are config, not Prometheus series — do not invent gauges. Per-node price/location/instance type are not exported. No model-name labels. Router /metrics only; do not add a production :11436 scrape.",
